<title>HUNGARY: Hungary central bgt deficit widens to HUF 150bln.</title>
<headline>Hungary central bgt deficit widens to HUF 150bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's cumulative central budget deficit widened to 150.0 billion forints in May from 126.7 billion forints in April, the Finance Ministry said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>BUDGET (BLN FORINTS)</p>
<p>		   Jan-May 97   Jan-April 97   Jan-May 96</p>
<p>    REVENUES	933.9	 774.5	     769.0</p>
<p>    EXPENDITURES 1083.9	 901.2	     860.5</p>
<p>    BALANCE	 150.0	 126.7		91.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures do not include one-off revenues, e.g. privatisation revenues.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
